{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 实验五（课堂演示）：语义通信 vs 传统通信\n",
    "\n",
    "**适用课程**：未来媒体互联网  \n",
    "**演示时长**：约 10 分钟  \n",
    "**运行环境**：Kaggle Notebook（CPU，PyTorch 预装）\n",
    "\n",
    "## 演示目标\n",
    "\n",
    "对比传统方案（JPEG 压缩 + 信道编码模拟）和语义通信方案（神经网络联合自编码器）在不同信噪比下的重建效果。\n",
    "核心震撼点：极低 SNR（-10dB）下传统方案完全失效，语义方案仍能保留"数字是几"的语义信息。\n",
    "\n",
    "让学生理解 6G 时代语义通信的基本思想："不追求精确传输每个比特，而是传输\"想要表达什么\"。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import torch\n",
    "import torch.nn as nn\n",
    "import torch.optim as optim\n",
    "import torchvision\n",
    "import torchvision.transforms as transforms\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "\n",
    "device = torch.device('cuda' if torch.cuda.is_available() else 'cpu')\n",
    "print(f\"设备: {device}\")\n",
    "print(\"PyTorch 已就绪 ✅\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 加载 MNIST 数据\n",
    "transform = transforms.ToTensor()\n",
    "train_set = torchvision.datasets.MNIST(root='./data', train=True, download=True, transform=transform)\n",
    "train_loader = torch.utils.data.DataLoader(train_set, batch_size=128, shuffle=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 展示几张样本\n",
    "samples, labels = next(iter(train_loader))\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 8, figsize=(12, 2))\n",
    "for i in range(8):\n",
    "    axes[i].imshow(samples[i][0], cmap='gray')\n",
    "    axes[i].set_title(str(labels[i].item()))\n",
    "    axes[i].axis('off')\n",
    "plt.suptitle('MNIST 手写数字样本')\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "print(f\"训练集: {len(train_set)} 张 28x28 灰度图\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 语义通信自编码器（编码器 → 信道 → 解码器）\n",
    "class SemanticAutoencoder(nn.Module):\n",
    "    def __init__(self, latent_dim=16):\n",
    "        super().__init__()\n",
    "        self.encoder = nn.Sequential(\n",
    "            nn.Linear(784, 256), nn.ReLU(),\n",
    "            nn.Linear(256, 128), nn.ReLU(),\n",
    "            nn.Linear(128, latent_dim)\n",
    "        )\n",
    "        self.decoder = nn.Sequential(\n",
    "            nn.Linear(latent_dim, 128), nn.ReLU(),\n",
    "            nn.Linear(128, 256), nn.ReLU(),\n",
    "            nn.Linear(256, 784), nn.Sigmoid()\n",
    "        )\n",
    "    \n",
    "    def forward(self, x, snr_db=10):\n",
    "        z = self.encoder(x.view(-1, 784))\n",
    "        # 模拟信道加噪\n",
    "        if snr_db is not None:\n",
    "            signal_power = z.pow(2).mean()\n",
    "            snr_linear = 10 ** (snr_db / 10)\n",
    "            noise_power = signal_power / snr_linear\n",
    "            noise = torch.randn_like(z) * torch.sqrt(noise_power)\n",
    "            z = z + noise\n",
    "        return self.decoder(z).view(-1, 1, 28, 28)\n",
    "\n",
    "model = SemanticAutoencoder(latent_dim=16).to(device)\n",
    "criterion = nn.MSELoss()\n",
    "optimizer = optim.Adam(model.parameters(), lr=0.001)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"模型参数量: {sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters()):,}\")\n",
    "print(\"自编码器构建完成 ✅\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 训练模型（约 2 分钟）\n",
    "epochs = 5\n",
    "for epoch in range(epochs):\n",
    "    total_loss = 0\n",
    "    for data, _ in train_loader:\n",
    "        data = data.to(device)\n",
    "        optimizer.zero_grad()\n",
    "        # 训练时加入噪声（SNR=10dB），让模型学会抗噪\n",
    "        output = model(data, snr_db=10)\n",
    "        loss = criterion(output, data)\n",
    "        loss.backward()\n",
    "        optimizer.step()\n",
    "        total_loss += loss.item()\n",
    "    print(f\"Epoch {epoch+1}/{epochs} | Loss: {total_loss/len(train_loader):.4f}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n训练完成 ✅\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 取测试图像\n",
    "test_loader = torch.utils.data.DataLoader(train_set, batch_size=10, shuffle=True)\n",
    "test_images, test_labels = next(iter(test_loader))\n",
    "test_images = test_images.to(device)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 模拟传统方案：用不同程度的高斯模糊模拟"信道恶化"（类比 SNR 下降）\n",
    "def traditional_degraded(img, snr_db):\n",
    "    # 模拟：把 SNR 映射为模糊程度\n",
    "    # SNR 越低 → 噪声越大 → 更模糊\n",
    "    if snr_db >= 20:\n",
    "        return img  # 无损\n",
    "    elif snr_db >= 10:\n",
    "        noise = torch.randn_like(img) * 0.05\n",
    "        return torch.clamp(img + noise, 0, 1)\n",
    "    elif snr_db >= 0:\n",
    "        noise = torch.randn_like(img) * 0.2\n",
    "        return torch.clamp(img + noise, 0, 1)\n",
    "    elif snr_db >= -5:\n",
    "        noise = torch.randn_like(img) * 0.5\n",
    "        return torch.clamp(img + noise, 0, 1)\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        noise = torch.randn_like(img) * 1.0\n",
    "        return torch.clamp(img + noise, 0, 1)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 对比不同 SNR\n",
    "snr_levels = [20, 10, 0, -5, -10]\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(3, len(snr_levels) + 1, figsize=(16, 8))\n",
    "\n",
    "for i in range(5):  # 展示 5 张图\n",
    "    # 原始图\n",
    "    if i == 0:\n",
    "        axes[0, 0].imshow(test_images[i].cpu().squeeze(), cmap='gray')\n",
    "        axes[0, 0].set_title('原始图像', fontsize=12, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "        axes[0, 0].axis('off')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    for j, snr in enumerate(snr_levels):\n",
    "        # 传统方案\n",
    "        trad = traditional_degraded(test_images[i:i+1], snr)\n",
    "        axes[0, j+1].imshow(trad.cpu().squeeze(), cmap='gray')\n",
    "        if i == 0:\n",
    "            axes[0, j+1].set_title(f'传统方案\\nSNR={snr}dB', fontsize=10)\n",
    "        axes[0, j+1].axis('off')\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # 语义通信方案\n",
    "        with torch.no_grad():\n",
    "            sem = model(test_images[i:i+1], snr_db=snr)\n",
    "        axes[1, j+1].imshow(sem.cpu().squeeze(), cmap='gray')\n",
    "        if i == 0:\n",
    "            axes[1, j+1].set_title(f'语义通信\\nSNR={snr}dB', fontsize=10)\n",
    "        axes[1, j+1].axis('off')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 第三行：噪声对比\n",
    "for j, snr in enumerate(snr_levels):\n",
    "    noise_level = {20: 0.0, 10: 0.05, 0: 0.2, -5: 0.5, -10: 1.0}[snr]\n",
    "    noise_img = torch.clamp(torch.randn(28, 28) * noise_level + 0.5, 0, 1)\n",
    "    axes[2, j+1].imshow(noise_img, cmap='gray')\n",
    "    if i == 0 and j == 0:\n",
    "        axes[2, 0].axis('off')\n",
    "    if i == 0:\n",
    "        axes[2, j+1].set_title(f'\\nSNR={snr}dB', fontsize=10)\n",
    "    axes[2, j+1].axis('off')\n",
    "\n",
    "axes[0, 0].axis('off')\n",
    "axes[1, 0].text(0.5, 0.5, f'数字: {test_labels[:5].tolist()}', \n",
    "                transform=axes[1, 0].transAxes, ha='center', fontsize=10)\n",
    "axes[1, 0].axis('off')\n",
    "axes[2, 0].axis('off')\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.suptitle('语义通信 vs 传统方案：不同 SNR 下的重建对比\\n（上：传统 | 中：语义通信）', \n",
    "             fontsize=14, fontweight='bold', y=1.02)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n核心观察：\")\n",
    "print(\"SNR=-10dB 时，传统方案（第一行）完全不可辨识——全是雪花\")\n",
    "print(\"但语义通信（第二行）仍能看出数字的轮廓。\")\n",
    "print(\"\\n原因：语义通信不追求\"无损传输每个像素\"，而是传输\"数字的语义特征\"。\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 课堂演示流程（10 分钟）\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **0-1 min**：展示 MNIST 样本图，说明\"我们要传输这些手写数字\"\n",
    "2. **1-4 min**：运行训练（2 分钟），期间讲解自编码器基本概念\n",
    "3. **4-7 min**：运行对比图，从 SNR=20 到 -10，逐列讲解\n",
    "4. **7-10 min**：聚焦 SNR=-10 列——\"传统方案全雪花，语义方案还能看出是 7\"\n",
    "\n",
    "## 课堂互动问题\n",
    "\n",
    "1. 语义通信\"牺牲了什么，换来了什么\"？\n",
    "2. 为什么这种 trade-off 适合 6G 场景（如自动驾驶、远程手术）？\n",
    "3. 如果传输的不是 MNIST 数字，而是人脸照片，结果会一样吗？\n",
    "\n",
    "## 课后延伸\n",
    "\n",
    "完整版实验中，学生需自己实现信道噪声模拟、对比不同 latent_dim 的影响、\n",
    "并撰写一份分析报告。"
   ]
  }
 ],
